				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					365b
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλον δένδρεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					4.5.2
				</span></i>
			 ; of armour, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				9.15
			</span></i> ; <i>enclose</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περόνη π. λίθον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procop.
					<u>Aed.</u>
					3.1
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>separate off</i> for oneself, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέρος [τῆς στοᾶς] αὐλαίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hyp.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					139
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίλοις περιπεφραγμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλις περιπεφρ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Sm.
				<u>Ps.</u>
				30(31).22
			</span></i> ; <i>to be obstructed</i>, f.l. for
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραφρ</span>-in <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
